              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe mpela mugakuŵecetela Maloŵe ga Mlungu kuti, “Mlungu ŵam'weni jwalakwejo kuti ali jwakulungama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
