          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maloŵega gakusala soni ya uweji ŵele ŵitucisimanikwa kuti tuli ŵakulungama pakumkulupilila Mlungu, jwele juŵamjimwisye Yesu",
